📗
  🔬 A minimal assertion helper for test programs. Include it with 📜.

    🆕🔬 🔤bytes🔤❗️ ➡️ check
    🔢 check 🔤adds up🔤 1 ➕ 1 2❗️
    ↩️ 🏁 check❗️          💭 prints a summary; 0 when nothing failed, otherwise 1
📗
🐇 🔬 🍇
  🖍🆕 suite 🔡
  🖍🆕 passed 🔢
  🖍🆕 failed 🔢

  🆕 name 🔡 🍇
    name ➡️ 🖍suite
    0 ➡️ 🖍passed
    0 ➡️ 🖍failed
  🍉

  🔒❗️ ✅ 🍇
    passed ➕ 1 ➡️ 🖍passed
  🍉

  🔒❗️ 💥 name 🔡 detail 🔡 🍇
    failed ➕ 1 ➡️ 🖍failed
    😀 🔤  FAIL 🧲suite🧲: 🧲name🧲: 🧲detail🧲🔤❗️
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* is 👍. 📗
  ❗️ 👌 name 🔡 actual 👌 🍇
    ↪️ actual 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤expected 👍🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when the two strings are equal. 📗
  ❗️ 🔡 name 🔡 actual 🔡 expected 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ actual 🙌 expected 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got "🧲actual🧲", expected "🧲expected🧲"🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when the two integers are equal. 📗
  ❗️ 🔢 name 🔡 actual 🔢 expected 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ actual 🙌 expected 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got 🧲actual🧲, expected 🧲expected🧲🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* has a value equal to *expected*. 📗
  ❗️ 🎁 name 🔡 actual 🍬🔡 expected 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ actual ➡️ value 🍇
      🔡 👇 name value expected❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got no value, expected "🧲expected🧲"🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* has no value. 📗
  ❗️ 🕳 name 🔡 actual 🍬🔡 🍇
    ↪️ actual ➡️ value 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got "🧲value🧲", expected no value🔤❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when the two byte sequences are equal. 📗
  ❗️ 📇 name 🔡 actual 📇 expected 📇 🍇
    ↪️ actual 🙌 expected 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got 🧲📏 actual❓🧲 bytes that differ from the 🧲📏 expected❓🧲 expected🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* is at most *most*. 📗
  ❗️ 🔽 name 🔡 actual 🔢 most 🔢 🍇
    ↪️ actual ◀️🙌 most 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤got 🧲actual🧲, expected at most 🧲most🧲🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* contains *needle*. 📗
  ❗️ 🔍 name 🔡 actual 🔡 needle 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ 🔍 actual needle❗️ ➡️ index 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤"🧲needle🧲" not found in "🧲actual🧲"🔤❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Passes when *actual* does not contain *needle*. 📗
  ❗️ 🚫 name 🔡 actual 🔡 needle 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ 🔍 actual needle❗️ ➡️ index 🍇
      💥 👇 name 🔤"🧲needle🧲" found in "🧲actual🧲"🔤❗️
    🍉
    🙅 🍇
      ✅ 👇❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Prints the summary. Returns 0 when nothing failed, otherwise 1. 📗
  ❗️ 🏁 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    😀 🔤🧲suite🧲: 🧲passed🧲 passed, 🧲failed🧲 failed🔤❗️
    ↪️ failed ▶️ 0 🍇
      ↩️ 1
    🍉
    ↩️ 0
  🍉
🍉
